# "You may play lands from your graveyard" lasts while Mole Man is on the battlefield. Bot1 plays Marsh Flats and cracks it on
# turn one (two landfalls, two Moloids; the Flats are in the graveyard). On turn two Bot2 plays a Mountain: not a land Bot1
# controls, so no third Moloid, and bolts the Mole Man. On turn three the Flats can no longer be played from the graveyard (the
# refusal; the positive control is the existing scenario, where Mole Man lives).

